# Drafts are committed for the push-driven factory loop, but GitHub Pages
# runs Jekyll (no .nojekyll) and never publishes underscore-prefixed
# directories — `_drafts/` can never be served publicly (same mechanism as
# thuexemayhanoi/blog). The Jekyll exclusion contract is enforced by
# ci-validate.yml + tests/test-suite.js + capacity-check.js.

# Assembled matrix (canonical form = 4 shards data/content-matrix.csv.part00..03)
data/content-matrix.csv

# Local build intermediate — public outputs are promoted to repository root by
# scripts/site/build-site.js (branch Pages: main / (root)); root tree is committed.
site/

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.log
